1. Register on MOSDAC portal
2. Use MOSDAC Data Download API with `config.json` specifying `datasetId`, time range, geographic bounds
3. Files arrive as HDF5 with exact channel names (`IMG_VIS`, `IMG_TIR1`, etc.) matching BLINK's parser
4. Our existing `MOSDACParser.read_hdf5()` should work with minimal modification

